Below is a progressive set of (≤ 10) BigQuery SQL statements that walk from very simple inspection queries up to one that delivers the requested navigation flow string for pseudo-user `1362228.4966015575` on `2021-01-28`.  
(Replace the project id if you have copied the public dataset into your own project.)

```sql
-- 1️⃣ Description: Quick look at every row we have for the user on 28-Jan-2021.
